OL,3,GNEWSAMosque expanding to create two
OL,4,Aprayer rooms
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurrey Muslim Centre is set to expand
OL,7,Fso the former church site can be turned
OL,8,Finto two separate prayer rooms - though
OL,9,Fcapacity will stay the same.
OL,11,FThe decision still needs signing off by
OL,12,FRunnymede Borough Council's planning
OL,13,Fchief once a flood risk assessment has
OL,14,Fbeen done.
OL,16,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,17,FReporting Service, the mosque in Albert
OL,18,FRoad, Addlestone, was established by
OL,19,FSurrey Islamic Trust in 2008 to unite
OL,20,Fgenerations in prayer, learning, and
OL,21,Fservice.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
